ential (Type A)",code:"A"},{sl:2,occupancy:"A1 Single family detached / row house / plot size not more than 134 sqm (semi-detached) residential building",req:"1 car parking",category:"Residential (Type A)",code:"A1"},{sl:3,occupancy:"A1 Single family detached / row house / plot size more than 134 sqm (semi-detached) residential building",req:"2 car parking",category:"Residential (Type A)",code:"A1"},{sl:4,occupancy:"A2 Two-family house",req:"2 car parking",category:"Residential (Type A)",code:"A2"},{sl:5,occupancy:"A3 Multi-family residential building: For flats with gross area more than 200 sqm",req:"1 car parking for every flat exceeding 200 sqm + 5% guest parking of total units",category:"Residential (Type A)",code:"A3"},{sl:6,occupancy:"A3 Flats with gross area from 140 sqm to 200 sqm",req:"2 car parking for every 3 units",category:"Residential (Type A)",code:"A3"},{sl:7,occupancy:"A3 Flats with gross area from 90 sqm to 140 sqm",req:"1 car parking for every 2 units",category:"Residential (Type A)",code:"A3"},{sl:8,occupancy:"A3 Flats with gross area from 60 sqm to 90 sqm",req:"1 parking for every 4 units",category:"Residential (Type A)",code:"A3"},{sl:9,occupancy:"A3 Flats with gross area up to 60 sqm (in addition to car parking)",req:"1 motorcycle parking for every 5 units",category:"Residential (Type A)",code:"A3"},{sl:10,occupancy:"A5 Hotel (star category)",req:"1 car parking for every 5 guest beds",category:"Residential / Lodging (Type A)",code:"A5"},{sl:11,occupancy:"A5 Hotel (other than star category)",req:"1 car parking for every 200 sqm of gross area",category:"Residential / Lodging (Type A)",code:"A5"},{sl:12,occupancy:"A4 (Mess, dormitory & hostel)",req:"1 car parking for every 300 sqm of gross area",category:"Residential / Lodging (Type A)",code:"A4"},{sl:13,occupancy:"A6 – Temporary residence",req:"As per requirement, one motorcycle space; no car parking required",category:"Residential (Type A)",code:"A6"},{sl:14,occupancy:"Educational Institution (Occupancy Type-‘B’) – Kindergarten, primary school, secondary school, higher secondary, college, university, tertiary educational institution, technical training centre, open school & other educational institutions",req:"1 car parking for every 200 sqm of gross area + compliance with Code Table 3.F.3; for kindergarten & primary school, cycle parking shall also be provided",category:"Educational (Type B)",code:"B"},{sl:15,occupancy:"Institutional (Occupancy Type-‘C’)",req:"1 car parking for every 200 sqm of gross area",category:"Institutional (Type C)",code:"C"},{sl:16,occupancy:"Health Care (Occupancy Type-‘D’) – Hospital, clinic, nursing home",req:"1 car parking for every 5 beds",category:"Healthcare (Type D)",code:"D1"},{sl:17,occupancy:"Health Care (Occupancy Type-‘D’) – Diagnostic centre, laboratory",req:"1 car parking for every 100 sqm of gross area",category:"Healthcare (Type D)",code:"D2"},{sl:18,occupancy:"Health Care (Occupancy Type-‘D’) – Outdoor department, physiotherapy, chamber",req:"1 car parking for every 200 sqm of gross area",category:"Healthcare (Type D)",code:"D3"},{sl:19,occupancy:"Office & other uses (Occupancy Type-‘E’)",req:"1 car parking for every 200 sqm of gross area + compliance with Code Table 3.F.3",category:"Business & Office (Type E)",code:"E"},{sl:20,occupancy:"Commercial (Occupancy Type-‘F’) – Shop, department store, shopping complex, etc.",req:"1 car parking for every 200 sqm of gross area; 1 car parking for every 2000 sqm of gross area for shops less than 2000 sqm + compliance with Code Table 3.F.3",category:"Mercantile / Commercial (Type F)",code:"F1"},{sl:21,occupancy:"Commercial (Occupancy Type-‘F’) – Restaurant",req:"1 car parking for every 100 sqm of gross area",category:"Mercantile / Commercial (Type F)",code:"F3"},{sl:22,occupancy:"Industrial (Occupancy Type-‘G’) / Warehouse (Occupancy Type-‘H’)",req:"In addition to loading-unloading, minimum 1 truck parking (10 m long) & 1 car parking shall be provided. For places with FAR area more than 3000 sqm, 1 truck parking (10 m long) for every additional 3000 sqm. For pure office floors in industrial buildings & warehouses (sales etc.), 1 car parking for every 200 sqm of gross area + compliance with Code Table 3.F.3",category:"Industrial & Storage (Type G & H)",code:"G"},{sl:23,occupancy:"Assembly (Occupancy Type-‘I’) – Cinema hall",req:"1 car parking for every 40 seats",category:"Assembly (Type I)",code:"I1"},{sl:24,occupancy:"Assembly (Occupancy Type-‘I’) – Theatre, auditorium",req:"1 car parking for every 20 seats",category:"Assembly (Type I)",code:"I2"},{sl:25,occupancy:"Assembly (Occupancy Type-‘I’) – Sports",req:"1 car parking for every 200 seats",category:"Assembly (Type I)",code:"I3"},{sl:26,occupancy:"Assembly (Occupancy Type-‘I’) – Party centre / Community centre",req:"1 car parking for every 25 sqm",category:"Assembly (Type I)",code:"I4"},{sl:27,occupancy:"Hazardous (J)",req:"In addition to loading-unloading, minimum 1 truck parking (10 m long) & 1 car parking shall be provided. For places with FAR area more than 3000 sqm, 1 truck parking (10 m long) for every additional 3000 sqm. For pure office floors (sales etc.) in industrial buildings & warehouses, 1 car parking for every 200 sqm of gross area + compliance with Code Table 3.F.3",category:"Hazardous (Type J)",code:"J"},{sl:28,occupancy:"Religious establishment",req:`Up to 300 sqm – minimum 1 car parking space
Above 300 sqm – 1 car parking for every 40 sqm of gross floor area or as determined by the Authority`,category:"Assembly / Religious (Type I)",code:"I5"},{sl:29,occupancy:"Others",req:"1 car parking for every 200 sqm of gross area + compliance with Code Table 3.F.3",category:"Other Uses",code:"K"}],zfe=["In case of mixed use, parking space shall be calculated on the basis of the nature of use of each floor of the building and the total parking requirement shall be the sum of the parking requirements determined for each use.","In case of more than one type of occupancy, the parking requirement for each occupancy shall be calculated separately and the total shall be taken as the total parking requirement.","Parking spaces of less than 1 (one) shall be counted as 1 (one) parking.","For flats up to 90 sqm, parking may be provided jointly for cars and motorcycles.","In case of A6, only motorcycle parking is required. For any other type of building, a minimum of 1 (one) car parking shall be provided. Where there is no provision for road widening and the road width is less than 6 m, minimum car parking shall not be required for residential buildings on such roads as per the condition of land use.","In case of hotels, the number of parking spaces shall be determined by adding the minimum required number for assembly facilities if the hotel has assembly facilities.","For TOD areas, parking shall be provided as per the TOD guidelines. In case of any ambiguity regarding parking, the Code and regulations shall be followed.","Parking may be provided in parking floors of minimum 1.9 m clear height."],zy=[{key:"res_lg",label:"Residential Dwelling (> 200 m²)",category:"Residential (Group A)",clause:"BNBC 2020 Part 3 Table 3.F.3",rule:"1 car space per unit",unitType:"units",defaultVal:10},{key:"res_md",label:"Residential Dwelling (100 - 200 m²)",category:"Residential (Group A)",clause:"BNBC 2020 Part 3 Table 3.F.3",rule:"1 car space per 2 units",unitType:"units",defaultVal:8},{key:"