  3. DAP Amendment 2025 — Block FAR Saroni 3.31, Incentives Saroni 3.28, Appendix 3.6
</div>

<!-- FOOTER -->
<div class="footer">
  <span>FAR Calculator &nbsp;·&nbsp; RAJUK DAP 2022–2035</span>
  <span>${Q?"Block FAR":"FAR"} &nbsp;·&nbsp; ${j.id}</span>
</div>

</body>
</html>
